{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C", "description": "This file implements the core functions for interacting with a parameter tree in a TR-069/DSLH-like environment using CCSP/Cosa frameworks on a platform-independent basis. It includes functions for retrieving child object names, parameter names, parameter values, parameter info, applying configuration changes, and managing access to parameters, objects, and their attributes via D-Bus interfaces. It supports operations like get/set parameter values of various types, object addition/deletion, and handling hierarchical parameter structures. The file is part of the SLAP (Service Logic Aggregation Plane) component and is specifically tailored for use within RDK-based broadband device management systems.", "external_files": ["slap_dslh_paramto_global.h", "safec_lib_common.h"], "external_methods": ["STRCPY_S_NOCLOBBER", "ERR_CHK", "AnscSizeOfString", "AnscCloneString", "free_componentStruct_t", "free_parameterValStruct_t", "free_parameterInfoStruct_t", "free_parameterAttributeStruct_t", "free_componentStruct_t", "SlapAllocStringArray2", "SlapFreeVarArray", "SlapAllocStringArray", "SlapAllocStringArray2", "sprintf_s"], "published": ["SlapDslhParamtoGetChildObjNames", "SlapDslhParamtoGetParamNames", "SlapDslhParamtoGetParamValue", "SlapDslhParamtoGetParamTypeAndValue", "SlapDslhParamtoSetParamValue", "SlapDslhParamtoSetParamValueString", "SlapDslhParamtoSetParamValueInt", "SlapDslhParamtoSetParamValueUint", "SlapDslhParamtoSetParamValueBool", "SlapDslhParamtoApplyChanges", "SlapDslhParamtoGetParamInfo", "SlapDslhParamtoGetParamInfoShort", "SlapDslhParamtoGetHiddenInfo", "SlapDslhParamtoGetObjectInfo", "SlapDslhParamtoAddObject", "SlapDslhParamtoDelObject", "SlapDslhParamtoAcqWriteAccess", "SlapDslhParamtoRelWriteAccess", "SlapDslhParamtoIsParamTreeReadOnly", "SlapDslhParamtoIsParameterReadOnly", "SlapDslhParamtoEscapeXmlString"], "classes": [], "methods": [{"name": "ULONG SlapDslhParamtoGetObjectInfo(ANSC_HANDLE hThisOb